# Xbox Controller Button List
# name        id    type     bitmask    axis_min axis_max  binded to

A             0     button   0x0001     -         -         KB_ENTER
B             1     button   0x0002     -         -         KB_b  
X             2     button   0x0004     -         -         KB_x
Y             3     button   0x0008     -         -         KB_y

LB            4     button   0x0010     -         -         default
RB            5     button   0x0020     -         -         default

BACK          6     button   0x0040     -         -         default
START         7     button   0x0080     -         -         default
GUIDE         8     button   0x0100     -         -         default

LSTICK_PRESS  9     button   0x0200     -         -         default
RSTICK_PRESS 10     button   0x0400     -         -         default

DPAD_UP      11     button   0x0800     -         -         KB_w
DPAD_DOWN    12     button   0x1000     -         -         KB_s
DPAD_LEFT    13     button   0x2000     -         -         KB_a
DPAD_RIGHT   14     button   0x4000     -         -         KB_d

LT           15     axis     -          0         255       default
RT           16     axis     -          0         255       default

LSTICK_X     17     axis     -         -32768    32767      default
LSTICK_Y     18     axis     -         -32768    32767      default
RSTICK_X     19     axis     -         -32768    32767      default
RSTICK_Y     20     axis     -         -32768    32767      default
